(These tests validate data correctness and ACID guarantees under concurrent load. Unlike the I/O tests \(which measure) Tj
T* (performance\), stress tests verify that the database produces correct results under contention -- that data is not silently corrupted,) Tj
T* (that transactions are properly isolated, and that concurrent modifications do not violate application invariants. Any failure in these) Tj
T* (tests is a significant finding.) Tj
