/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.314 0.333 0.373 rg
56.6929133858267775 193.3230708661415065 Td
(Inserts rows in multi-row INSERT batches \(e.g., 100 rows per statement\) to measure sustained write ingestion throughput.) Tj
T* (Performance is governed by: transaction log write bandwidth \(the primary bottleneck for most cloud databases\), B-tree page) Tj
T* (splits \(when new keys fall between existing index entries, the page must be split and redistributed\), index maintenance overhead) Tj
T* (\(each additional secondary index multiplies the per-row insert cost\), auto-statistics update triggers \(which can pause inserts while) Tj
T* (statistics are recomputed\), and checkpoint interference \(periodic dirty-page flushing competes for I/O bandwidth\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Directly relevant for ETL pipelines, Change Data Capture \(CDC\) replication targets, event streaming ingestion, and any workload) Tj
T* (that bulk-loads data. Results are reported as rows/second and MB/s.) Tj
